Scope of this verdict: CD4.1 criteria (a)-(h) and CD4.2 items 1-4. Every claim
below comes from a command I ran on a `cp -a` copy of the tree at <scratch>/cd4a2-tests/tree.
I removed the copy's worktree .git file, then ran `git init` and committed a snapshot.
Before starting and again before writing this file, `sha256sum -c .swarm/manifests/CD4.2.sha256`
reported all 11 paths OK. The sidecar hash is ea20b626...fac1e.

