Item 4 PASS. I applied each mutation alone to an rsync copy and ran both shipped
  suites, under caller en_US.UTF-8 and again under caller C.
  - M-a (stats loop from a=1): the gate suite fails "codex: stats counts (row, attempt)
    pairs from attempt 0".
