    - with an en_US caller: 12 gate FAILs and 2 dashboard fails;
    - with a C caller: still 12 gate FAILs ("[C.utf8] DETAIL:<U+2003> ... want rc 0
      got 1") plus the dashboard skip-headers test.
    So the tests set their own UTF-8 locale.
  - M-f (parseAllVerdicts back to readFileIfExists): 7 dashboard fails. The directory
    case is an assertion failure ("EISDIR" in the child) and the suite completes all
    126 tests.
  - Extra mutants, all killed:
